2026-10-25T10:11:17.6105110Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6644960Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6672980Z [0m
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6673720Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6674330Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6678280Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6678570Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6679210Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6679680Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6680330Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6680810Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6681310Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6682160Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6682720Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6683170Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6684420Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6684560Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6684700Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6684910Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6685170Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6685540Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6686130Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6686260Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6686440Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6687860Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6688250Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6722150Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6723710Z I will:
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6725260Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6725680Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6726470Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6727330Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6728220Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6729030Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6729540Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6730360Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6731280Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6768700Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6769200Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6811930Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6813430Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6814730Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6816200Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6817620Z 
