2026-10-25T10:11:17.6885550Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6887110Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-10-25T10:11:17.6887470Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
